{
  "schema": "ClimateFieldOwnershipLedger",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "notes": "B8 P0 field-writer ledger. The parity table in gdext/src/runtime_climate_parity.cpp is the single definition of which fields belong to the Climate authority; this ledger records, for each of them, who writes it on the production path and which main-thread writer must therefore be suppressed once the worker owns the domain. tools/runtime/runtime_climate_stage_order_contract_test (GDScript) fails when a parity field is missing here, when the recorded parity_stage/kind/comparability drift from the C++ table, or when an extra_policy/pending field is not present in authority-stage-c-field-policy.json. Keep it in sync with the parity table, not with memory.",
  "allowed_active_writers": [
    "climate_worker",
    "main_thread_season_refresh",
    "main_thread_succession",
    "main_thread_raster",
    "transport_readonly"
  ],
  "allowed_suppression": [
    "native_daily_graph",
    "weather_refresh",
    "ocean_currents",
    "sea_ice_daily",
    "season_refresh",
    "none"
  ],
  "internal_state": {
    "synoptic_psi": {
      "state_fields": ["psi", "psi_prev"],
      "target_phase": "P2-done-partial",
      "active_writer": "climate_worker",
      "worker_owned": true,
      "writeback": false,
      "production_writers": ["weather_refresh:run_weather_field_solve_pass(start_idx==0)"],
      "suppression": ["none"],
      "note": "B8-2 子项：worker 自持 synoptic ψ / ψ_prev，不是 MapData 数组、不在 parity 表里（因此也不在 fields 校验范围）。生产 capture 只提供冷启动种子；SHADOW 直接用生产那一帧（不自己推进），ACTIVE 用共享 synoptic_advance_pure + 自己的 tick 推进。效果通过它驱动的 weather 场（vapor / cloud_water / cloud_cover / weather_precipitation / instability）在 parity 里可见。CLM2 ABI 4 起随 store 持久化（进 state_hash）；ABI 3 旧档读入时两条 lane 全零并记录 cold-seed 行为。E6 开关：PK_CLIMATE_SYNOPTIC_OFF=1。"
    },
    "wind_traj": {
      "state_fields": ["traj_idx", "traj_w"],
      "target_phase": "P2-done-partial",
      "active_writer": "transport_readonly",
      "worker_owned": false,
      "writeback": false,
      "production_writers": ["world_ext_physical:_phys_wind_traj_idx/_w"],
      "suppression": ["none"],
      "note": "B8-2：轨迹表由主线程物理求解构建，capture 通过 runtime_weather_traj_snapshot() 导出，资格判定与 weather field solve 的消费端逐条一致（表已建 + knob 允许消费 + 指纹匹配当前风场）。任何一条不满足就保持空，worker 与生产一起走 hopping 回退。求解器整体迁入 worker 后这条才可能变成 worker-owned。"
    },
    "monsoon_thermal": {
      "state_fields": ["monsoon_thermal"],
      "target_phase": "P2-done-partial",
      "active_writer": "transport_readonly",
      "worker_owned": false,
      "writeback": false,
      "production_writers": ["world_ext_physical:_phys_monsoon_thermal"],
      "suppression": ["none"],
      "note": "B8-2：主线程物理求解的热力季风派生量，作为 weather field solve 的只读输入 transport。求解器迁入 worker 之前它是输入而不是 worker 状态；允许为零。"
    },
    "cyclone_state": {
      "state_fields": ["cyclone_entries", "cyclone_next_stable_id"],
      "target_phase": "P2-done",
      "active_writer": "climate_worker",
      "worker_owned": true,
      "writeback": false,
      "production_writers": ["world_ext_weather:_advance_and_stamp_cyclones", "world_ext_weather:cyclone_wake_step(genesis)"],
      "suppression": ["native_daily_graph", "weather_refresh"],
      "note": "B8-2 完成态：推进/衰减/stamp 与 genesis 全部由 worker 自持（CLM2 ABI 6 的 cyclone_state blob，cyclone_state_encode/decode 由生产 capture、worker 冷启动播种与存档共用）。per-cell 强迫 lane 是当天派生量、不回灌 MapData；worker 把 stamp 直接喂给自己的 field solve。genesis 的**前沿等价物是 weather_intensity lane**（生产 front intensity 就是 cluster 内最大 cell intensity；不能再要求 weather_type==STORM，那要已有 stamp 才成立，是闭锁），纬度带用规范 cell_lat_norm（生产 pos_y/world_bounds 在小地图上退化，见 CycloneLanes::lat_norm 注释），其余物理闸与生产 native-entity 分支逐条一致。验证：kernel self_test（推进+stamp+codec+genesis 注入/替换/容量）、PK_CLIMATE_CYCLONE_FORCE=1 + PK_CLIMATE_CYCLONE_GENESIS_GATE=0.6 的 160 天 soak（day=52/76/116 injected=1，day=60/84 decayed=1 且 int(before/after)=0.625/0.000），以及 [climate/worker][b8] cyclone/cyclone_lat/cyclone_genesis 漏斗诊断。"
    }
  },
